stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> PENDING: Customer sends booking<br/>(or owner books for a customer)
  PENDING --> CONFIRMED: Owner confirms<br/>date, time and a note are required
  PENDING --> CANCELLED: Customer cancels<br/>or owner declines
  CONFIRMED --> COMPLETED: Owner marks the job done
  CONFIRMED --> CANCELLED: Customer cancels<br/>or owner cancels
  COMPLETED --> Reviewed: Customer leaves 1-5 stars
  Reviewed --> Published: Owner approves
  Reviewed --> Hidden: Owner hides
  CANCELLED --> [*]
  Published --> [*]
  Hidden --> [*]
